author: "harness:claude-code"
estimated_minutes: 120
acceptance_criteria: "import type { ProjectedGraphResult } from '@unbrained/pm-cli/sdk/graph' and from '@unbrained/pm-cli/sdk' compile under NodeNext with strict and skipLibCheck false; The conflict_resolution union of MergeDecisionReceipt has an exported public name (for example MergeConflictResolution) that the receipt declaration uses, importable from sdk/merge and from the aggregate entrypoint; The SDK surface gate fails when a type referenced by an exported function's public signature is not importable from the same entrypoint, with a negative control that removes one such re-export; A packed-consumer fixture with type-only imports of these names runs beside the existing value-export parity checks"
parent: pm-9rgaal
risk: low
confidence: high
severity: low
repro_steps: "In a NodeNext strict project with skipLibCheck false: import type { ProjectedGraphResult } from '@unbrained/pm-cli/sdk/graph' fails with TS2305"
resolution: "scripts/sdk-surface-snapshot.mjs now refuses an entrypoint whose exported functions or exported value annotations name a package type it does not export (analyzeSignatureTypeReachability, identity by declaration), following type references, inline import types, type queries (including a queried value's, method's or property's own signature, with a cycle guard), enum members and class prototypes; _testOnly test seams are counted as exempt, not gated. The snapshot records signature_type_reachability per entrypoint. All gaps found were closed with type-only re-exports (ProjectedGraphResult from sdk/graph and the aggregate, HistoryEntry, UpdateManyResult, PmSettings for sdk/merge and others) plus export keywords on module-local types, and ExtensionCapability now names one declaration. MergeDecisionReceipt.conflict_resolution is typed by the exported ItemScalarConflictResolution."
expected_result: "Types named in public SDK signatures are importable by name from the entrypoint that exports the function, and the gate fails when one is not"
actual_result: "sdk-surface-snapshot --check passes with zero gaps; tests/types imports ProjectedGraphResult, ItemScalarConflictResolution, MergeDecisionReceipt, HistoryEntry and ExtensionActivationResult as type-only imports and typechecks; the unit spec covers every declaration form; negative control: deleting the ProjectedGraphResult re-export makes the gate fail naming runGraph"
affected_version: 2026.11.4
component: sdk
